title=3D+Printed+Terrain+for+Tabletop+Games%3A+Beginner+Guide&slug=3d-printed-terrain&content=%3Ch1%3E3D+Printed+Terrain+for+Tabletop+Games%3A+Beginner+Guide%3C%2Fh1%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EShort+answer%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+For+tabletop+terrain%2C+choose+FDM+for+large%2C+sturdy+pieces+and+resin+for+detail-rich+small+pieces.+Print+walls+and+ruins+at+0.2+mm+layer+height+with+8%E2%80%9310%25+infill%2C+prime+with+filler-primed+spray%2C+and+paint+fast+with+contrast+paints+and+drybrushing.+One+well-chosen+print+settings+page+saves+you+a+spool+of+failed+plastic.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EDisclosure%3A+Some+links+on+this+page+are+affiliate+links+%E2%80%94+if+you+buy+through+them%2C+we+may+earn+a+small+commission+at+no+extra+cost+to+you.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EFDM+vs.+Resin+Printers+for+Terrain%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cfigure+class%3D%22wp-block-table%22%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%3E%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EFDM%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EResin%3C%2Fth%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Fthead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EBest+for%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ELarge+ruins%2C+walls%2C+hills%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ESmall+details%2C+interior+pieces%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EBuild+size%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ELarge+%28typically+220%C3%97220%C3%97250+mm%2B%29%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ESmall+%28typically+130%C3%9780+mm%29%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EDurability%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ETough%2C+game-safe%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EBrittle+%E2%80%94+drops+crack+it%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EMess%2Fventilation%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EMinimal%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ERequires+gloves+%2B+ventilation%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ERunning+cost%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ECheap+filament%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EResin+costs+more+per+volume%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EBeginner+verdict%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3E%3Cstrong%3EFirst+printer%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ESecond+printer%2C+or+for+small+models%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Ftbody%3E%3C%2Ftable%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%0A%3Cp%3EFor+a+first+terrain+project%2C+FDM+wins%3A+terrain+is+big%2C+and+big+resin+prints+fail%2C+smell+and+cost.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EBest+Settings+for+Clean%2C+Sturdy+Sci-Fi+Walls+and+Ruins%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ELayer+height%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+0.2+mm+%280.28+mm+acceptable+for+big+blocks%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EInfill%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+8%E2%80%9310%25+gyroid+%E2%80%94+terrain+doesn%27t+need+strength+inside%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EWalls+%28perimeters%29%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+3+for+tabletop+durability%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESupports%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+tree+supports+for+arches%3B+orient+flat+faces+upward+to+hide+layer+lines%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESpeed%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+slow+the+first+layer%3B+speed+barely+matters+on+long+straight+walls%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThe+dirty+secret+of+terrain+printing%3A+%3Cstrong%3Elayer+lines+are+free+texture.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Concrete%2C+cast+metal+and+adobe+surfaces+read+%3Cem%3Ebetter%3C%2Fem%3E+with+slight+line+texture.+Reserve+ultra-fine+printing+for+display+pieces.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EPrimer+and+Painting+Prep+for+3D+Prints%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Col%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EDe-string+and+sand%3C%2Fstrong%3E+contact+faces+so+pieces+sit+flush%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EFill+deep+layer+lines%3C%2Fstrong%3E+on+display+surfaces+with+filler+primer+%28one+coat%2C+sand%2C+repeat+once%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESpray+prime%3C%2Fstrong%3E+dark+grey+or+black+%E2%80%94+dark+prime+hides+the+seams+that+survive%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EGlue+terrain+to+a+base%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%28MDF+or+foam+board%29+%E2%80%94+unbased+prints+warp+and+chip%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Fol%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EQuick+Contrast-Painting+Methods+for+Large+Pieces%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3ETerrain+is+where+speed+techniques+shine+%E2%80%94+one+wall+is+%22miniature+surface%22+a+hundred+times+over%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Col%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESpray+the+base+colour%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%28grey-brown+for+ruins%29+%E2%80%94+a+rattle+can+does+in+minutes+what+a+brush+does+in+hours%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EContrast-style+paint+over+the+whole+piece%3C%2Fstrong%3E+with+a+large+brush+%E2%80%94+one+pass%2C+no+blending%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EDrybrush%3C%2Fstrong%3E+the+raised+edges+in+a+lighter+stone+tone+%E2%80%94+this+is+80%25+of+the+visual+payoff%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EWash+the+lowest+third%3C%2Fstrong%3E+darker+to+ground+the+piece%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EOptional%3A+%3Cstrong%3Epigments%3C%2Fstrong%3E+on+horizontal+ledges+for+dust+%28see+%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Feasy-weathering-techniques%2F%22%3Eeasy+weathering%3C%2Fa%3E%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Fol%3E%0A%3Cp%3EA+full+table+of+terrain+%28a+dozen+pieces%29+is+a+two-weekend+project+with+this+method.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3ERecommended+Printers+and+Filaments%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cfigure+class%3D%22wp-block-table%22%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%3EItem%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EWhy%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3ELevel%3C%2Fth%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Fthead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EBeginner+FDM+printer%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ELarge+build+volume+beats+fancy+features%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EBeginner%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EPLA%2B+filament+%28grey%29%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ESturdy%2C+hides+lines%2C+cheap%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EAll%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EFiller+primer+spray%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ESmooths+layer+lines+fast%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EAll%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ELarge+drybrush+set%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ETerrain-sized+tools+for+terrain-sized+jobs%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EAll%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Ftbody%3E%3C%2Ftable%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3E%28Affiliate+links+%E2%80%94+buying+through+them+supports+the+workbench.%29%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EFAQ%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EIs+3D+printing+terrain+cheaper+than+buying+it%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EAfter+the+printer+investment%2C+yes+%E2%80%94+dramatically.+A+kilo+of+filament+yields+months+of+terrain+for+the+price+of+two+retail+boxes.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EDo+I+need+to+worry+about+licenses+on+printed+models%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EYes+%E2%80%94+check+each+file%27s+license.+Personal-use+licenses+forbid+selling+prints%3B+many+creators+sell+commercial+licenses+separately.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat+size+should+tabletop+terrain+be%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EMatch+your+game%27s+scale%3A+for+28%E2%80%9332+mm+miniatures%2C+walls+50%E2%80%9380+mm+tall+and+ruins+footprint+100%E2%80%93200+mm+work+well.+Print+one+test+piece+before+committing+to+a+full+table.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow+do+I+make+terrain+survive+transport%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EPrint+in+modular+sections+with+flat+contact+faces%2C+base+everything%2C+and+store+in+a+box+with+foam+dividers.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EContinue+on+the+Workbench%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Fkitbashing-guide%2F%22%3EKitbashing+Guide%3A+Unique+Sci-Fi+Miniatures%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+print+bitz%2C+not+just+walls%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Feasy-weathering-techniques%2F%22%3EEasy+Weathering+Techniques+for+Miniatures%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+pigments+on+printed+concrete%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Frust-and-battle-damage%2F%22%3EHow+to+Paint+Rust%2C+Chipping+and+Battle+Damage%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+ruins+love+rust%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Flore%2Flost-expedition-stories%2F%22%3E7+Lost+Expeditions+Into+the+Warpstorm%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+wreck-terrain+inspiration%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EA+printed+ruin+beats+an+unplayed+table.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Print+one+wall+section+this+week%2C+paint+it+in+one+evening%2C+and+put+it+on+the+table.+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fshop%2Fprinters%2F%22%3EShop+beginner+printers+%E2%86%92%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%3Cem%3E%28affiliate+links%29%3C%2Fem%3